list-XML/issues/767#issuecomment-465836281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":465836281,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2NTgzNjI4MQ==","user":{"login":"DennisClark","id":4991620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTE2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4991620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark","html_url":"https://github.com/DennisClark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DennisClark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-02-21T02:25:57Z","updated_at":"2019-02-21T02:27:02Z","body":"@alanorth   I believe we can start with this one.  I'm afraid that the serious restrictions in the license could be a concern, and may prevent it from meeting SPDX License List guidelines:\r\n\r\n```\r\nAttribution — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made. You may do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that suggests the licensor endorses you or your use.\r\n\r\nNonCommercial — You may not use the material for commercial purposes.\r\n\r\nNoDerivatives — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you may not distribute the modified material. \r\n```\r\n\r\nalthough I suppose that since we are talking about usage by government organizations that other considerations may apply.    This needs discussion by the Legal group.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/465836281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/466230246","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767#issuecomment-466230246","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":466230246,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2NjIzMDI0Ng==","user":{"login":"alanorth","id":191754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTc1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth","html_url":"https://github.com/alanorth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanorth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-02-22T00:56:30Z","updated_at":"2019-02-22T00:57:12Z","body":"@DennisClark Sorry, I don't understand. You mean that SPDX would have a problem with the attribution, non-commercial, and no-derivatives restrictions of the Creative Commons licenses in general or something about the IGO ones? The [SPDX list](https://spdx.org/licenses/) already has versions 1.0, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, and 4.0 of 