/api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":466691445,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ2NjY5MTQ0NQ==","user":{"login":"mlinksva","id":40415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2019-02-23T20:37:27Z","updated_at":"2019-02-23T20:37:27Z","body":"A different issue that this intersects with is that there are literally hundreds of CC licenses \"ported\" to various jurisdictions not cataloged by SPDX https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/618#issuecomment-372803130\r\n\r\nIt seems like each (non-open licenses, \"ported\" CC licenses) ought be considered carefully. This license happens to touch both.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/466691445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/470709673","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767#issuecomment-470709673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":470709673,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3MDcwOTY3Mw==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-03-07T21:53:30Z","updated_at":"2019-03-07T21:53:30Z","body":"Discussed on 2019-03-07 legal team call. Participants had varying opinions, and there was not a clear consensus, whether this one should be added. Observations included the following:\r\n\r\n1. CC licenses currently on the License List were initially added prior to the current candidate license guidelines becoming more crystallized. \r\n2. The fact that other CC-NC-* licenses were previously added is a relevant consideration, but not dispositive, for whether new ones should be added going forward.\r\n3. There is evidence that CC-BY-NC-ND-3.0-IGO has some significant usage in the wild. See \r\nhttps://wiki.creativecommons.org/wiki/Intergovernmental_Organizations#Examples_of_CC_License_Use_by_Intergovernmental_Organizations (note though that not all examples listed are this -IGO variant).\r\n4. Whether or not this one is added, there is not a current appetite for adding every single possible other ported CC license.\r\n\r\nAnyone who was attending, please weigh in if you feel I'm misrepresenting any of the discussion  :)\r\n\r\nThe next steps that were discussed included that there may be discussion of this during the SPDX face-to-face next week, but in any event this will be raised again on a subsequent legal team call for further consideration and a decision.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/470709673/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/475321629","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767#issuecomment-475321629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":475321629,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3NTMyMTYyOQ==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-03-21T17:12:55Z","updated_at":"2019-03-21T17:12:55Z","body":"discussed again on 2019-03-21 call - still struggling with what to do here. In addition to points above:\r\n- given the status and recognizability of CC as a license steward, it would be good to have the more \"blessed\" licenses. the IGO variation seems to be such a case (as well as other IGO variants like SA, etc.) but would be good to have input from CC on this...\r\n- this also touches upon bigger issue of accepting more licenses (generally and/or that are not strictly open source) on the SPDX License List, which then in turn touches upon the issue of a small number of volunteers doing all the work.\r\nthus - tagging for next release to allow more time for some of these bigger issue conversations.\r\n@mlinksva  - are you still working with CC? ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/475321629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/537950680","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767#issuecomment-537950680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/767","id":537950680,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNzk1MDY4MA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscr